<section class="notes">
  <p><b>An agent that is uncertain and wrong</b> beats one that is confident and wrong. The uncertain one escalates; the confident one fails quietly.</p>
  <p><b>Without a golden dataset and an eval</b> you are hoping, not knowing. There is no third option before go-live.</p>
  <p><b>If you are building your first agents,</b> design now for operating a hundred of them.</p>
</section>
